     "description": "affine: a (%·√GeV), se_a, b (%), se_b, rho_ab, se_a_stat, se_b_stat; pinned: a0, se_a0, se_a0_stat; quadrature: a, se_a, b (null when B ≤ 0), se_b, b2 (%²), se_b2, b_defined, a2, se_a2, a_defined, se_a_stat, se_b_stat. SEs are scaled by scale_factor; *_stat are not. No block carries a note: its facts are its fields."
